&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role &amp;amp; Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Payroll Operations Specialist supports the administrative and compliance foundation that enables customers to operate across state jurisdictions. You&#39;ll manage payroll tax registrations, agency accounts, foreign qualifications, tax correspondence, unemployment claims, and other compliance-related services while partnering closely with Payroll Operations, Customer Support, Implementation, Benefits, external vendors, and state agencies to deliver an exceptional customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
