&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written communication and customer service skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable researching regulations and navigating government agency websites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently while collaborating across cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–3 years of experience in payroll operations, payroll tax registrations, compliance, Secretary of State filings, or other regulatory or administrative operations is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
