&lt;p&gt;Mercury is built for the building class: those who act on their ambition, who see something that doesn&#39;t exist and decide to make it real with their time, money, and team; whether that&#39;s a side project or a scaling unicorn. We build the financial stack for them, backed by elegant and intelligent software meant to work from day one to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dashboard is the home base of Mercury and the connective tissue between everything you need: home, search, tasks, notifications, and the moment-to-moment sense of place and priority. When it&#39;s done right, it feels like a thousand tiny things working invisibly in your favor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Mercury grows more capable, it also grows more complex. Our job is to make sure customers only ever feel the first part: to take an increasingly powerful product and keep it legible, no matter how much is happening underneath it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our product should meet customers where they are: every task closed, every intent read correctly, every alert landing before it&#39;s needed. We aim to make our customers feel that their ambition is inevitable.&lt;/p&gt;
